{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","title":"Coolingdown package baru itu delay gate, bukan freeze dependency update","desc":"Minimum release age harus berbasis risk tier dan environment, bukan aturan satu ukuran untuk semua.","updated":1778645245348,"created":1778643474023,"tags":["til","security","supply-chain","dependency-management"],"custom":{},"fname":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"6ddc5c5d310f5b9a7a4f70eacaee2275","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","id":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.til","alias":"til","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.til"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","id":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.security","alias":"security","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.security"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","id":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.supply-chain","alias":"supply-chain","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.supply-chain"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","id":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.dependency-management","alias":"dependency-management","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.dependency-management"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy","id":"notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":107,"column":3,"offset":3470},"end":{"line":107,"column":53,"offset":3520},"indent":[]},"value":"til.security.cooldown-is-delay-gate-not-freeze"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"mpwj4tnqpuqmt84tgnlw1k3","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"coolingdown-package-baru-itu-delay-gate-bukan-freeze-dependency-update\">Coolingdown package baru itu delay gate, bukan freeze dependency update<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#coolingdown-package-baru-itu-delay-gate-bukan-freeze-dependency-update\"></a></h1>\n<p>TIL: coolingdown dalam konteks supply-chain modern bukan berarti berhenti update selamanya. Itu artinya: jangan jadi pengguna pertama yang mengeksekusi versi package baru di environment bernilai tinggi.</p>\n<p>Yang masuk akal adalah risk-tiered minimum release age:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>default dependency biasa: 24–72 jam</li>\n<li>tooling sensitif / build/AI tooling: 3–7 hari</li>\n<li>package baru / maintainer baru / high-risk package: 7 hari+ plus review</li>\n<li>emergency security fix: exception lane dengan sandbox/testing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Jadi policy yang sehat adalah mengubah siapa yang boleh update, kapan, di mana, dan lewat jalur apa.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">til (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">supply-chain (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">dependency-management (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy\">NPM supply-chain cooldown policy</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note"